OL,11,G0232 Assignment
OL,12,     FIn Germany the system makes it
OL,13,     Fhard for disabled people to find
OL,14,     Fwork. Often they find jobs in
OL,15,     Finstitutions that pay less than
OL,16,     Fminimum wage. So how could Germany
OL,17,     Fbe more inclusive?
